Package: scrollwm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: experimental scrollable tiling window manager for X11
 ScrollWM is a keyboard-first tiling window manager with a scrollable layout,
 workspaces, configurable keybindings, and X session integration.
